id: pm-dczodv
title: "ADR: Lifecycle-sensitive graph partitions are advisory; stable all-status outcomes carry blocking assurance"
description: "Active-item graph populations change during honest claim, close, and release transitions. Blocking delivery on their absolute census would make normal PM lifecycle operations fail the release gate. Retain active-partition measurements and negative controls as warnings for diagnosis, while stable all-status outcome reachability, structural fragility, integrity, and semantic relationship assertions remain blocking."
